/**
 * Finance Tracker • Private Multi-Currency Expense & Subscription Tracker
 * Features:
 * - High-Accuracy Receipt & Email Parser (Midjourney, Apple, OpenAI, Netflix, Stripe, etc.)
 * - Permanent Offline Receipt Photo & Document Storage (IndexedDB)
 * - Full-Res Receipt Attachment Viewer Modal (Images, PDFs, Forwarded Emails)
 * - Designated Dashboard Receipt & Email Dropzone (.eml, .pdf, .jpg, .png, text)
 * - Fullscreen Drag-and-Drop Ingestion (Drag directly from Apple Mail / Outlook / Gmail)
 * - Inbound Email Forwarding Ingestion & Cloudflare Email Worker
 * - Live Exchange Rates (USD, EUR, ILS) with offline caching
 * - Tri-Currency breakdown per expense ($ • € • ₪)
 * - Subscription & Recurring Bills Watcher with Price Hike / Change Alerts
 * - 100% LocalStorage & IndexedDB / Privacy-first
 */

